## 04.6 Responsive shell

### Desktop

- persistent top navigation;
- persistent sidebar;
- independent content scrolling;
- dense workspace layout.

### Tablet

- sidebar may collapse;
- content remains structured;
- top navigation remains available;
- controls may condense.

### Mobile

- top navigation remains global;
- sidebar becomes a drawer;
- content becomes single-column or intentionally stacked;
- tables use controlled horizontal scrolling, responsive row layouts, or detail views;
- secondary controls move into drawers where appropriate.

