# 05. Route Rules

All routes:

- lowercase;
- kebab-case;
- meaningful;
- stable;
- refresh-safe;
- deep-linkable.

Collections use plural nouns.

Examples:

```text
/projects
/students
/groups
/tasks
```

Specific resources use IDs.

```text
/projects/:projectId
/students/:studentId
```

Nested routes preserve resource context.

Query parameters are for:

- filters;
- sorting;
- search;
- view state;
- pagination;
- temporary list configuration.

Routes are for resource identity.

