# 50. Anti-Patterns Explicitly Rejected

The following are not part of the GrowFlow V1 design direction:

- generic SaaS template appearance;
- excessive glassmorphism;
- neon AI interfaces;
- rainbow role themes;
- card-everything dashboards;
- excessive shadows;
- giant pills everywhere;
- unnecessary gradients;
- decorative charts;
- animated background noise;
- fake AI typing;
- excessive parallax;
- stock-heavy storytelling;
- unreadably small metadata;
- inconsistent icon families;
- inconsistent radii;
- dark mode as simple inversion;
- arbitrary frontend-calculated business truth;
- direct browser-to-AI-provider calls;
- browser-owned long-running AI jobs;
- unauthorized role switching;
- impersonation as a normal admin feature.

